    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d476-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d476-f1-content">
                <p>This document was prepared as a U.S. position paper by the Department of State
                    Working Group for the preliminary tripartite conversations in Washington, August
                    29–September 1, in preparation for the meeting of the Foreign Ministers of the
                    United States, the United Kingdom, and France in New York, September 12–14 and
                    18–19. Documentation on these meetings is scheduled for publication in volume
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">iii</hi>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
